    "sections": {
        "description": "BlogChrome is a customizable WordPress blog, news, and magazine theme built as a child theme of ChromeNews. Ideal for personal blogs, online newspapers, digital magazines, editorial websites, and news portals, it features a classic widgetized layout with custom news widgets and flexible widget areas for creating engaging homepages and organizing featured stories. Get started quickly with ready-made starter sites and customize your website using the WordPress Customizer, live previews, Gutenberg blocks, block patterns, and the Elementor page builder. BlogChrome also integrates with the AF Themes ecosystem, including BlockSpare for additional Gutenberg blocks, AI-powered website building, dynamic content, and advanced publishing layouts; EleSpare for Elementor kits and templates; AF Companion for optimization tools; and WP Post Author for author-related features. With responsive layouts, light and dark color modes, WooCommerce compatibility, and RTL language support, BlogChrome is suitable for technology blogs, lifestyle magazines, review websites, and professional publishing platforms. Explore starter sites at https://afthemes.com/products/chromenews/blogchrome/#aft-view-starter-sites, watch tutorials at https://www.youtube.com/@wpafthemes/, find setup instructions at https://docs.afthemes.com/chromenews/, or get help at https://afthemes.com/supports/."
    },
